<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .form-field-label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 120px; }
  .line-input { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 20px; width: calc(100% - 120px); }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">Jacksonville State University</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 5px 0;">Houston Cole Library</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 5px 0;">({{ phone_number }}) {{ extension }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Application for</p>
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 5px 0;">SPECIAL PERMIT CHECK-OUT CARD</h3>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">NAME</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="name">{{ name }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">MAILING ADDRESS</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">EMAIL ADDRESS</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">HOME PHONE</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="home_phone">{{ home_phone }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">CELL</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="cell">{{ cell }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">DRIVER'S LICENSE#</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="driver_s_license">{{ driver_s_license }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-field-label">ISSUING STATE</span>
        <div class="line-input" data-field="issuing_state">{{ issuing_state }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>I understand I may check out 5 books, agree to return all books checked out to me on or before the due date, and pay any overdue charges. I also understand that the Library has the right to recall any book I may have if needed by a JSU student, faculty, or staff member. If I lose a book, I will pay the replacement cost, plus cost of processing. I also understand that I will forfeit the privilege to use my SPECIAL PERMIT CARD if I do not return books when due.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <span class="form-field-label">Signature</span>
      <div class="line-input" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <span class="form-field-label">Date</span>
      <div class="line-input" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>
      <span data-field="fee_amount">{{ fee_amount }}</span> fee for SPECIAL PERMIT CARD payable before the permit will be issued. The fee is payable to Houston Cole Library.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div>
      <span class="form-field-label">Paid</span>
      <div class="line-input" style="width: 100px;" data-field="paid">{{ paid }}</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      revised <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>